WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:08.750
This has to be seen to be believed, and it's
almost as sad as it is unbelievable a Donald

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:11.370
Trump has forced his way back on to Twitter.

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:15.750
He's tweeting by writing letters, which are
then published and retweeted by his kids and

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:16.750
friends.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:21.199
This is a former president, folks, you might
recall that Donald Trump was banned from Twitter

00:00:21.199 --> 00:00:24.800
sometime ago for constantly, persistently,
endlessly, stubbornly inciting violence and

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:27.499
telling lies about the 2020 election results.

00:00:27.499 --> 00:00:31.910
He is now putting out statements through his
Save America PAC, which are often duplicates

00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:34.559
from things he's posting to gab some kind
of right wing social network.

00:00:34.559 --> 00:00:45.750
And it's all on Donald Trump letterhead.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:58.550
But these are now tweets.

00:00:58.550 --> 00:01:05.619
He is he is publishing letters that are just
tweets.

00:01:05.619 --> 00:01:12.829
Yesterday, Trump put one out that says statement
by Donald Trump, 44th president of the United

00:01:12.829 --> 00:01:13.829
States.

00:01:13.829 --> 00:01:17.690
Wouldn't it be fantastic if the legendary
Herschel Walker ran for the United States

00:01:17.690 --> 00:01:19.509
