00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:50.590
No, I don't think so.

00:02:50.590 --> 00:02:53.530
I don't even think that they should.

00:02:53.530 --> 00:03:07.270
But if we're honest, this does violate the
spirit of the ban.

00:03:07.270 --> 00:03:29.780
I mean, it is ban evasion and it's all so
