00:03:29.780 --> 00:03:48.220
And I know that some 

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:55.700
are saying nobody should even mention that
Trump is doing this.

00:03:55.700 --> 00:03:58.950
You're amplifying it by sharing it.

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:00.650
